Observed: focused durable acceptance test records app.listen({host:"127.0.0.1",port:0}) once after both a FAILED required result and a thrown runner exception.
Expected: no bootstrap/listen unless every required migration is terminal-success; a fully successful required result starts once.
Preliminary classification: implementation defect at the server-runtime migration/startup boundary. The canonical migration is requiredOnStartup, but startConfiguredServer ignores returned FAILED statuses and catches/continues thrown runner failures.
